  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0ecb0313c05100280c41082fd02a8b070a03cd8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0ecb0313c05100280c41082fd02a8b070a03cd8\" data-origin-width=\"1692\" data-origin-height=\"766\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이런 거...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">새 용어 많이 나오는 단원에서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">PPT로 복습할 때 만들어서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">많이 썼는데</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">웹앱으로 만드니</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">1줄씩만 입력해도</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">알아서 PPT를 만들어줘서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">편하네요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c1a51c71643109a04d5b9501485068fb517fadf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c1a51c71643109a04d5b9501485068fb517fadf\" data-origin-width=\"837\" data-origin-height=\"832\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">1줄씩 교과서 설명을 복붙하고</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">(강조하고 싶은 단어는</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">긁어 아래 &lt;강조&gt; 버튼을)<br><br>시작하면</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b03d411131481196328b5cb2c3e7e484c1329b2f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b03d411131481196328b5cb2c3e7e484c1329b2f\" data-origin-width=\"1881\" data-origin-height=\"1079\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd5a11c63f012f3359204f436cb32bef8fbb1322\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd5a11c63f012f3359204f436cb32bef8fbb1322\" data-origin-width=\"1873\" data-origin-height=\"1051\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8724aeaa6d810f6e6ad3c05b0aa9bbc063937bfd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8724aeaa6d810f6e6ad3c05b0aa9bbc063937bfd\" data-origin-width=\"1871\" data-origin-height=\"1056\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">뭐... 이렇게 만들어줍니다.&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">ㅎㅎㅎ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">만든건 &lt;저장&gt; 해서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">내보내기 해두면 두고두고 쓸 수 있어요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이젠 아이디어가 중요하지&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">만드는 건 AI 가</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">다 알아서 하는 세상이라&#160;<br>참 좋네요.<br><br><a href=\"https://stringweek-cyber.github.io/ppt/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://stringweek-cyber.github.io/ppt/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"1줄 1장 PPT\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"stringweek-cyber.github.io\" data-og-source-url=\"https://stringweek-cyber.github.io/ppt/\" data-og-url=\"https://stringweek-cyber.github.io/ppt/\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://stringweek-cyber.github.io/ppt/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://stringweek-cyber.github.io/ppt/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">1줄 1장 PPT</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">stringweek-cyber.github.io</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
